2026-10-19T03:10:18.6035264Z 
2026-10-19T03:10:18.6035524Z The goal is a proposition, so `let` is preferred over `letI`.
2026-10-19T03:10:18.6036009Z The difference between `let` and `letI` is that `letI` inlines the value.
2026-10-19T03:10:18.6036503Z But this is not relevant for proofs because of proof irrelevance.
